 "chosen": 0,
 "why": "The rule turns every line of dialogue into a life-or-death choice, so the audience holds their breath on every word \u2014 and the hero's flaw (can't stop talking) is the exact tool that wins, via echoes.",
 "outline": [
  [
   "Hook",
   "0-4s",
   "Extreme close-up of an eyeless head in lightning: 'It has no eyes. It doesn't need them.'"
  ],
  [
   "Rule",
   "4-12s",
   "A cop starts a megaphone speech; the giant whips round and flattens his car mid-sentence."
  ],
  [
